Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[{
 "02",
 StyleBox["Neuron",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "State",
 StyleBox["Space",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "And",
 StyleBox["Biophysical",
  FontSlant->Italic],
 "Dynamics"
}], "Title",ExpressionUUID->"9db776e9-cc24-094e-9926-350e2af6e899"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Purpose", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"73915bdc-cfc7-9040-94d7-86192de4124d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This is ",
 StyleBox["Notebook 2",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " in the Neuron Series."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c77e2c36-b8b2-9f4e-9147-6fb0b4e4bfc2"],

Cell["\<\
Its purpose is to construct a rigorous mathematical foundation for neuron \
dynamics, beginning from established biophysical modeling and extending \
toward a broader measurement-aware computational framework.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"cd82888e-d904-5e45-b31f-749696d7bf4f"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook is explicitly designed to do three things well:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"57a2d6e1-9b0c-444d-9a48-31aeec39bcd3"],

Cell["1. formalize the neuron as a structured dynamical system,", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ac2dbe7f-f80b-a44d-a59b-37b1f51c9698"],

Cell["\<\
2. provide a reduction ladder from biophysically rich models to digital \
AI-usable approximations,\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1cae13c4-6aa7-f049-8d8d-6fc93d1b1959"],

Cell["\<\
3. establish a disciplined interface where RHUFT-style distinguishability, \
measurement, and closure variables can later be added without corrupting the \
biophysical core.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"97317e2f-3d6a-974a-992a-2ac500525f5b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This notebook does ",
 StyleBox["not",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " assume that speculative ontological claims are established biology. \
Instead, it builds the neuron mathematics in a layered way so that extensions \
can be inserted rigorously. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c2508923-5b53-a342-bddf-132b3acf21b5"],

